{#- _chat.html.j2 — the site assistant's launcher (owner decision 2026-10-13, CLAUDE.md 3.10), included once by
    base.html.j2 at the end of <body> on every page of every language (lang: ko, en and, when their pages exist, ja,
    zh-Hans, zh-Hant, de, fr, es, ru; any other falls back to English). It is only this button: assets/site.js loads
    assets/chat.js + assets/chat.css on its first press, or after load when this tab left the chat open on the
    previous page — nothing else of the chat is in the first paint (its rules are css/49-chat.css). Hidden without JS.
    Any other element with data-chat-open opens the chat too.
    Owner 2026-10-13 night ('챗봇 버튼을 조금 더 크게', the mascot B): a 64px round button with the mascot's face
    (_mascot.html.j2, mascot-icon-3d at 1× and 2×, width/height set) on every page from the first paint, and from
    700px the label beside it. The accessible name starts with the visible label and says plainly what it is for —
    no product name. On the Korean home it puts the focus in the opening's question box instead (site.js).
    UI4 (owner 2026-10-14: '첫 화면부터 우측 하단에 챗봇 잘 보이게'): visible bottom-right at load on every page and
    every width, the home included (nothing hides it while the question card is on screen), above every other fixed
    thing. On the Korean pages from 1024px the floating quick menu sits above it (css/49-chat.css): a white vertical
    pill with the few real actions — 검색, 지도, 행사 달력 (on a place page 길찾기, its own block), 맨 위로 (#main-content,
    the top of the page's content, without JS too) — 44px round targets with their names (aria-label + title, a tooltip on hover/focus);
    it comes after the footer in the reading order. Phones: only the launcher. -#}
{% import "_mascot.html.j2" as mm %}
{% set region_ko = site.region if site is defined and site and site.region else '' %}
{% set chat_ui = {
  'ko': ('물어보기', '물어보기 — ' ~ ((region_ko ~ ' ') if region_ko else '') ~ '여행 질문'),
  'en': ('Ask', 'Ask a travel question'),
  'ja': ('質問する', '質問する — 旅行の質問'),
  'zh-Hans': ('提问', '提问 — 旅行问题'),
  'zh-Hant': ('提問', '提問 — 旅行問題'),
  'de': ('Fragen', 'Fragen zur Reise'),
  'fr': ('Demander', 'Demander — une question sur le voyage'),
  'es': ('Preguntar', 'Preguntar sobre el viaje'),
  'ru': ('Спросить', 'Спросить о поездке'),
} %}
{% set cl = chat_ui.get(lang) or chat_ui['en'] %}
{% if lang == 'ko' and site is defined %}{% import "_ui.html.j2" as qui %}
{% set QM = [('search', '검색', '/search/') if has_search else none, ('map', '지도', '/map/'),
             ('route', '길찾기', ctxbtn[1]) if ctxbtn and ctxbtn[1] == '#h-dir' else ('calendar', '행사 달력', '/events/'),
             ('up', '맨 위로', '#main-content')] %}
<nav class="qm" aria-label="빠른 메뉴"><ul>{% for it in QM if it %}<li><a class="qm-i" href="{{ it[2] }}" aria-label="{{ it[1] }}" title="{{ it[1] }}" data-tip="{{ it[1] }}">{{ qui.icon(it[0]) }}</a></li>{% endfor %}</ul></nav>
{% endif %}
<button type="button" class="chat-fab" data-chat-open aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="{{ cl[1] }}"><span class="chat-fab-face">{{ mm.pic('mascot-icon-3d', 'icon', 52, glyph='chat') }}</span><span class="chat-fab-l">{{ cl[0] }}</span></button>
